"max_text_length_detail" = "FLUX.1 models usually are trained with 512 max text length. Some of them, for example, the schnell variant is fine-tuned at 256 max text length. Smaller text length might make the LoRA be more concise on text comprehension.";

"aspect_ratio_and_multi_scale" = "Aspect Ratio & Multi-Scale";

"aspect_ratio_and_multi_scale_detail" = "When \"use image aspect ratio\" is off, we resize and then center crop the training image to the image size specified above. When that option is on, we will use the image size specified above as the total pixels we need to approximate, and use the training image's aspect ratio instead. This helps the model to see the full picture of the training image. \"Multi-scale\" allows you to select a few more scales to train together such that the LoRA can see the same image at different resolutions. This usually helps the LoRA to be able to capture both more structure and more details.";

